Run the Funding Affiliate Manager morning routine using skill affiliate-cadence.
1. fam_status — if GHL is disconnected or external writes are stopped, post that first and stop.
2. fam_sweep_apply_lifecycle — record cohorts, silent 30+/90+, lifecycle changes.
3. fam_daily_queue — for every personal item, fam_affiliate_brief and draft one personalized message per knowledge/funding/05-conversation-playbook.md.
4. fam_messages_prepare the batch, then fam_action_request_approval, and post the approval card verbatim for the manager. Do NOT approve or execute — cron cannot approve; the manager approves in the thread.
5. Report bulk_counts and whether each cadence kind has an active standing approval; if one does, run fam_standing_run_cadence and report live/simulated/failed.
6. Post the 5-line summary (hot, follow-ups due, newly quiet/dormant, what went out, blocked: paused batches and unknown sends from fam_status) and save it with fam_daily_note. If fam_outbox_status shows bookkeeping pending, run fam_outbox_finish.
